Usage: cardano-cli dijkstra sub-transaction assemble --sub-tx-file FILEPATH
                                                       [--witness-file FILEPATH]
                                                       --out-file FILEPATH
                                                       

  Assemble an unsigned sub-transaction and key witnesses into a signed
  sub-transaction

Available options:
  --sub-tx-file FILEPATH   Input filepath of the JSON unsigned sub-transaction.
                           Use `-` to read from standard input.
  --witness-file FILEPATH  Filepath of the witness. Use `-` to read from
                           standard input.
  --out-file FILEPATH      Output filepath of the JSON signed sub-transaction.
  -h,--help                Show this help text
